  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling more accountable and effective humanitarian action through core humanitarian standards</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this project is to promote more accountable and appropriate humanitarian action for people affected by crises through common humanitarian standards and a coherent overall standards framework. This &#x2018;harmonisation&#x2019; will ensure that standards are more easily and frequently used by aid workers and organisations in delivering their programmes. Three outcomes will help to achieve this goal:

i) Development and delivery of a verifiable Core Humanitarian Standard that captures the fundamental issues at the heart of humanitarian work in a clear and concise way.
ii) Provision of awareness-raising activities and support to humanitarian actors to ensure successful use and implementation of the Core Humanitarian Standard.
iii)Proposition of a more coherent standards architecture that will link the various humanitarian standards together to promote stakeholders&#x2019; ease of use of a variety of standards, with the core humanitarian standards at the centre.</narrative>
  </description>
